<h2 class="g-h2" id="behaviour">Behaviour</h2>
<div class="g-prose"><p>A treated row is one link: to the citing opinion's Authorities row for this case (<code>#authority-N</code>) when the extraction found it, else to the quoted passage (<code>#q=…</code>), else to the opinion. The leading later treatment prefers a controlling or equal court over a persuasive one (<code>build_data._later_lead</code>). The disposition is always grey: what a court did with its own case says nothing about the case's standing.</p></div>

